	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>MySetlists uses the camera so you can scan a concert ticket stub to add the show to your history, or take a photo at a gig to share on that show&#8217;s page.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
	<string>MySetlists asks for this only if you choose to keep a copy of an image in your photo library, such as your Year in Review card. The app never saves anything without you asking.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>MySetlists accesses your photo library so you can choose an existing ticket stub to scan, or add your own concert photos and videos to a show you attended.</string>
